{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Fruit Salad Rug is a decorative piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"],". It is obtained by finishing ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],"'s ",["l","潘妮","14-Heart"]," event (and choosing the Strawberry Home option)."]],["p",["If the original is lost, a replacement can be purchased at the ",["l","秘密森林","Lost Items Shop"]," in the Secret Woods for 10,000g."]]]],["Note",2,[["p",["The Fruit Salad Rug is one of only four rugs that cannot be purchased via the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"],", ",["l","Joja家具目录","Joja Furniture Catalogue"],", ",["l","法师目录","Wizard Catalogue"],", ",["l","祝尼魔目录","Junimo Catalogue"],", or ",["l","复古目录","Retro Catalogue"],". The other three are the ",["l","海盗地毯","Pirate Rug"],", the ",["l","沙子地毯","Sandy Rug"],", and the ",["l","沙漠地毯","Desert Rug"],"."]]]]]}